{"id":1061204,"name":"玛格丽塔·审查Ⅳ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"玛格丽塔·审查Ⅳ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1061204]}],"trial":{"trial_id":61204,"stage":"阶段4","unlock_time":"2026-02-14 05:00:00","diary1":"玛格丽塔临变不惊，仍想以笑语掩饰锋芒，操控局势，却耐不住你言辞如刀，层层剖开她的冠冕堂皇。 \n　　面具滑落，柔光散尽，她终于舍了假象，不再故作纯善。虚渺的和平理想之下，你看到她真正的本心、阳谋，和让她立于不败之地的底牌。","diary2":"玛格丽塔的“和平”从不是妥协的美德，而是掌控的艺术，旁人于她而言不过是织锦里的绣线，是盘面上的棋子。 \n　　因而就算目标一致，你也绝不会继续放任她勾连。这一次，无论她扇影之下还有多少秘密，你都要自己来做棋手。","evidence":[{"ID":260883,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260884,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":